-- English creature texts without a broadcast text were shown untranslated to French players.
-- When the English line exists word for word in the client broadcast texts, that broadcast text is set, so the
-- client shows its own French; otherwise a French line goes to creature_text_locale. Lines sharing a group and
-- index get a free index, since creature_text_locale is keyed by group and index.
